        "id": 1002581
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-18T02:48:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Needed. progress is an int over only a 70-90 range, but this is called once per page (16B for XO3, 256B for XO5), so many consecutive calls compute the same truncated value. Without the guard, every one of those redundant calls would fire a PropertiesChanged signal.",
      "parentUuid": "7cc873c8_6a063760",
      "revId": "53689a290a701d42edabf171e07f81213c914cd2",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e7f12f41_acec1c94",
